## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Burst (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Hunter Strike, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar, Rose Gold Meteor
- Core: Hunter Strike, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy draft has low crowd control and you want the fastest cooldown-to-attack conversion.; Queen's Wings over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when physical or mixed dive reaches you before the shield from Rose Gold Meteor can decide the fight.; Immortality over Rose Gold Meteor when Use for repeated Lord fights where one revive is worth more than another damage passive.
- Total cost: 11930 gold

Default gold lane setup that stacks cooldown reduction, raw Physical Attack, and late penetration for Granger's Rhapsody into Death Sonata burst cycle.

### Anti-Frontline Gold (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Hunter Strike, Endless Battle, Malefic Roar, Sea Halberd, Immortality
- Core: Hunter Strike, Endless Battle, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Blade of Despair over Sea Halberd when Use when the enemy front line is durable but not built around healing, shielding, or high extra HP.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst when surviving the first combo matters more than a delayed revive.; Queen's Wings over Immortality when Use when you need cooldown reduction and damage reduction against divers who force extended skirmishes.
- Total cost: 11270 gold

Anti-frontline setup for tank, shield, or sustain drafts where Granger must damage the nearest durable target without dying to the first lockout.

### Jungle Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Magic Boots, Hunter Strike, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar, Brute Force Breastplate
- Core: Hunter Strike, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when early crowd control threatens your first Turtle path more than the extra cooldown reduction helps your damage.; Queen's Wings over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when you need the emergency damage reduction and cooldown refund more than stacked movement.; Sky Piercer over Brute Force Breastplate when Use only when you are snowballing and your team can protect your reset angles after the first pick.
- Total cost: 11990 gold

Jungle setup that prioritizes fast cooldown conversion, pick pressure, and Ice Retribution control so Granger can force mid-game fights around Turtle and Lord entrances.

